      "writtenOn": "2020-02-03T19:32:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "servo_detect has a higher priority (HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT-1) over ccd_ext_detect (HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT). I think it would be risky to allow ccd_ext_detect while servo_detect is delayed. If servo, ccd detection and ec_comm happened at the same time, then servo and ccd detection should be delayed to check in the next HOOK_SECOD based on their priority.",
      "parentUuid": "da0131b5_962ff09c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 367,
        "startChar": 53,
        "endLine": 368,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "2dc5212cad230e0fcadbc95258cb0a12650fe498",
